### 8.9 Data Status

#### Requirements

Dashboard topbar must show one of:

- `Trusted`
- `Warning`
- `Dirty`

#### Trusted

No critical reconciliation issue, no orphan events, no broken refs, no suspicious amount, pending clarification below threshold, and last sync valid.

#### Warning

Missing category, pending clarification, email candidate unresolved, CC payment unmatched, non-critical ref warning, or non-critical partial write.

#### Dirty

Broken balance, large suspicious amount, OTP/security email accidentally parsed, critical missing amount/account, duplicate critical issue, committed event with missing refs, sync failure, or formula error in primary metric.

#### Acceptance Criteria

- Data Status is computed from Data Quality Center.
- Primary dashboard cards display despite Dirty state, but trust warning is visible.
- Dirty issues appear in Action Required.

---

### 8.10 Proactive Telegram Alert Engine

#### Requirements

Proactive Telegram alerts must cover:

- CC due N days.
- Cash wallet below threshold.
- Data Status changes to Dirty.
- Partial write failure.
- Pending clarification older than threshold.
- Missing category above threshold.
- Critical reconciliation issue.

Alert fields:

```text
alert_id
alert_key
severity
message
source_event_ref
created_at
last_sent_at
cooldown_until
ack_status
quiet_hours_policy
```

#### Acceptance Criteria

- Critical alert can be pushed to Telegram.
- Warning alert respects cooldown.
- User can acknowledge alert.
- Duplicate suppression prevents spam.
- Dashboard Action Required and Telegram alerts stay consistent.

---

### 8.11 Email Ingestion

#### Requirements

Email ingestion is optional and default OFF. It must stay guarded until safe.

Allowed v1 behavior:

- Read-only first.
- Manual Gmail label.
- Sender allowlist.
- Negative keyword hard-block.
- Metadata-only parsing.
- No full email body storage.
- No markRead.
- No delete.
- No email modification in early v1.
- No automatic ledger write until parser is proven.

Sensitive hard-block keywords include:

```text
otp
kode
verifikasi
verification
login
security
password
reset
perangkat
device
one time password
2fa
authentication
auth code
kode keamanan
```

#### Acceptance Criteria

- `admin email sprint7 clarification bridge` reports dry-run/default-off status until enabled.
- No Gmail modifications occur in dry-run.
- No Finance Events/Account Ledger/Review Queue writes occur in design dry-run.
- Full email body is never stored.
- OTP/security content is never forwarded.
- Ambiguous email asks Telegram before routing.

